<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en-us"><generator uri="https://gohugo.io/" version="0.161.1">Hugo</generator><title type="html">徐徐微风</title><link href="https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/wsl/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="html"/><link href="https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/wsl/index.xml" rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="rss"/><updated>2026-08-22T19:28:08+00:00</updated><author><name>Daniel Diana</name></author><id>https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/wsl/</id><entry><title type="html">Wsl配置</title><link href="https://1024daniel.github.io/posts/dev_env/wsl%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/><id>https://1024daniel.github.io/posts/dev_env/wsl%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</id><author><name>Daniel Diana</name></author><published>2026-08-14T11:34:26+08:00</published><updated>2026-08-14T11:34:26+08:00</updated><content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>配置终端ll显示正常</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span style="display:flex;"><span>export LANG<span style="color:#f92672">=</span>C.UTF-8
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>export LC_ALL<span style="color:#f92672">=</span>C.UTF-8
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>alias ls<span style="color:#f92672">=</span><span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;ls --color=auto --quoting-style=literal --show-control-chars&#39;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>alias ll<span style="color:#f92672">=</span><span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;ls -alF&#39;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div>]]></content><category scheme="https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/wsl" term="wsl" label="wsl"/></entry></feed>